{"title":"2015 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/9/369015f68e2912f25d23af6ee3891ba1238e874a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{x+1}{x+4}=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"81\" height=\"40\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/d/e1dd1a4ae2f97662a8c23b38409ad714754bcedf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x+8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/5/63513854fc049973a3ab2ac96d37b7d2c907cedf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"20\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/2/b62868998f13b37a74423168800c40300a3bd7f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 1 = 4(x + 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/8/7c8d3fd06214f6b1375d7edede9e46c4dd66538a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x + 16 = x + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/c/2cc504404f3c6e0bb3e95d54f40e4476e24a2c0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x - x = 1 - 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/5/dc57f817f3d278a9488ddbf19f42241e409f04cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x = -15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/5/dc57f817f3d278a9488ddbf19f42241e409f04cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x = -15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/e/cdefbf097ea0b71fb131a06515d1dfc9444c943c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x + 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/a/d5aeee1e89946cd7d65deab2c47cfd7608329c1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-15 + 8 = \\boxed{-7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"124\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018000259\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 44/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1822/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.819      1 2015_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    5.819      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36013:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018000259 and revision id 279630. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}